    72	verdict, the issuance predicate or S. A2.1's ruling stands.
    73	
    74	**Cost.** U1 needs no new input: the six headers are already required, pinned and qualified (§7.1). It works
    75	offline in 2106. nTime is a uint32 and wraps at 2106-02-07, which the profile's time arithmetic already handles.
