    77	### U2: RFC 3161 tokens over SHA256(A_sig), alongside Bitcoin
    78	
    79	- **[F] Mechanism.** The TSA signs a TSTInfo containing `messageImprint = SHA256(A_sig)`, `genTime`, an optional
    80	  `accuracy`, a policy OID and an optional nonce. The TSA certificate carries the critical EKU id-kp-timeStamping
