   117	  their divergence is G1, G4, conjunct 3, or C-C10/C-C14's C-Q6. Any that remain divergent are listed when the
   118	  results are re-read under this amendment.
   119	- **Pending runs (A8.3, A8.4):** the eleven's (d) cells and C-C15(i)'s C-Q6 results stay as they are (not run
   120	  under this blob; withheld from discharge) until the pre-registered runs are frozen, run and read. A8.4's query
