   122	  blob and its other files are untouched.
   123	- **Out of scope, recorded for the relying-party story:** preventing a captured or merged authority from
   124	  issuing new attestations (`docs/guarantee-tiers-DRAFT.md`, "Authority capture").
   125	- **Unchanged:** the ceiling and its exceedance (6.46× over three ladders), and every box in §3's query
