    81	the known failures and by successful pilot attacks, and that history is disclosed here and in the
    82	pre-registration. Pre-registering fixes how the subsequent runs will be conducted and counted. **It does not
    83	erase the retrospective origin of the method.** The rejected alternatives are family evidence only (it narrows
    84	§A3.3), and restricting degraded verification to L0 (`proverif/dev/restriction/REPORT.md`: it makes D2 and
    85	D5 unseverable and kills four witnesses).
